## Writing to Sheets (Critical)
```python
# NEVER use 'USER_ENTERED' for cells starting with box-drawing chars
# Always use 'RAW' to prevent formula interpretation
sheets.spreadsheets().values().update(
    spreadsheetId=ss_id,
    range="FLOW_CHARTS!A1",
    valueInputOption='RAW',
    body=body
).execute()
```

## Status Markers
- `✅ ACQUIRED` = Acquired by Sevaganapalli Land Partners (SLP)
- `✅ DRA REALTY` = Acquired by DRA Realty Private Limited
- `❌ NOT DRA` = Not acquired, still with original/other parties
- `⚠️` = Issue/error in title or records
- `📄` = Revenue record, no separate digital file

## Legend
Always include a legend at the bottom of FLOW_CHARTS explaining markers.